{
  "description": "",
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "What this shows:\nOverall source disagreement score.\n\nWhy you care:\nMulti-source systems need to know when one source diverges from the others.\n\nHow to read it:\nRising lines show disagreement by source.\n\nWhat to do next:\nInspect the highest source in the table.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 16,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "mcRecipe": {
        "expectedMetrics": [
          "metricchrono_ai_source_disagreement_score"
        ],
        "tableColumns": [],
        "unitMarking": "percent"
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (stream) (metricchrono_ai_source_disagreement_score{service=\"$service\",environment=\"$environment\",model=\"$model\",workload=\"source_agreement\"})",
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "{{stream}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Are sources disagreeing?",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "What this shows:\nSources ranked by disagreement.\n\nWhy you care:\nThis identifies the outlier source.\n\nHow to read it:\nThe highest row is the first source to inspect.\n\nWhat to do next:\nInspect that source before changing policy.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 16,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 2,
      "mcRecipe": {
        "expectedMetrics": [
          "metricchrono_ai_source_disagreement_score"
        ],
        "tableColumns": [
          "stream",
          "model_version",
          "source_disagreement_score",
          "next_step"
        ],
        "unitMarking": "percent"
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "topk(6, max by (stream,model_version) (max_over_time(metricchrono_ai_source_disagreement_score{service=\"$service\",environment=\"$environment\",model=\"$model\",workload=\"source_agreement\"}[$__range])))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "source",
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Which source disagrees most?",
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "What this shows:\nSource disagreement split into small, medium, and large movement.\n\nWhy you care:\nThis separates minor source noise from serious disagreement.\n\nHow to read it:\nLarge movement means a source is materially different.\n\nWhat to do next:\nInspect the source with large movement.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 16,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "id": 3,
      "mcRecipe": {
        "expectedMetrics": [
          "metricchrono_ai_change_score_by_size"
        ],
        "tableColumns": [],
        "unitMarking": "percent"
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (change_size) (max_over_time(metricchrono_ai_change_score_by_size{service=\"$service\",environment=\"$environment\",model=\"$model\",workload=\"source_agreement\",change_size=~\"$change_size\"}[$__range]))",
          "format": "time_series",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{change_size}}",
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Is disagreement small or serious?",
      "type": "bargauge"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "What this shows:\nSource disagreement state over time.\n\nWhy you care:\nBounded disagreement is different from ongoing disagreement.\n\nHow to read it:\nWatch, Drift, or Incident state shows when disagreement was active.\n\nWhat to do next:\nInspect source logs for that period.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 16,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "id": 4,
      "mcRecipe": {
        "expectedMetrics": [
          "metricchrono_ai_drift_state"
        ],
        "tableColumns": [],
        "unitMarking": "none"
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (stream) (metricchrono_ai_drift_state{service=\"$service\",environment=\"$environment\",model=\"$model\",workload=\"source_agreement\"})",
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "{{stream}} state",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "When did disagreement start?",
      "type": "state-timeline"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "What this shows:\nMissing-source event rate.\n\nWhy you care:\nMissing sources can explain disagreement or weak decisions.\n\nHow to read it:\nA nonzero line means one source was absent in the demo.\n\nWhat to do next:\nInspect source availability before changing models.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 16,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "id": 5,
      "mcRecipe": {
        "expectedMetrics": [
          "metricchrono_ai_source_missing_total"
        ],
        "tableColumns": [],
        "unitMarking": "ops"
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (stream) (rate(metricchrono_ai_source_missing_total{service=\"$service\",environment=\"$environment\",model=\"$model\",workload=\"source_agreement\"}[$window]))",
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "{{stream}} missing",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Is one source missing?",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "What this shows:\nCurrent source agreement state.\n\nWhy you care:\nThis gives a simple source health summary.\n\nHow to read it:\n0 is Normal, 1 is Watch, 2 is Drift, and 3 is Incident.\n\nWhat to do next:\nIf elevated, inspect the highest-disagreement source.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 16,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16
      },
      "id": 6,
      "mcRecipe": {
        "expectedMetrics": [
          "metricchrono_ai_drift_state"
        ],
        "tableColumns": [],
        "unitMarking": "none"
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max(metricchrono_ai_drift_state{service=\"$service\",environment=\"$environment\",model=\"$model\",workload=\"source_agreement\"})",
          "format": "time_series",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Source status",
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Current source status?",
      "type": "stat"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "5s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": [
    "ai-observability",
    "mlops",
    "metricchrono",
    "recipe"
  ],
